    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44448" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὐμέν-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, Adj. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὐμένης</span>, pr. n. of two kings of Pergamum,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατιῶται</span>”
