					Polyaen.
					4.6.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὐμέν-εια</span></b> , τά, festival in honour of Eumenes II of
			Pergamum, at Pergamum, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				267.34
			</span></i>; at Aegina, ib.<i><span class="en">
				329.40
			</span></i>; at Sardes, ib.<i><span class="en">
				305.9
			</span></i>.</div>
